---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="sn-p.sh" description="Placeholder.">
  <p class="statement">Hi :)</p>

  <div class="body">
    This site is my space to shout thoughts into the void, for the most part.
    Writing helps me think through things I find it meditative, especially
    nowadays when I find myself doing less and less work "unassisted." All the
    writing here is my own.
  </div>
  <div style="height: 1rem;"></div>
  <div class="body">
    The site's name is a play on a "snapshot," whether of my life, my views at
    the time, places I've been, or similar.
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .statement {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    max-width: 22ch;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .body {
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .body p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
